# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release
/android/key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
*.pkcs12

# 개인용 환경 override (예: LAN IP는 네트워크마다 달라짐)
# config/dev.json 을 복사해 만들고 --dart-define-from-file=config/dev.local.json 로 사용
config/*.local.json
